{"product_id":"when-she-was-good","title":"When She Was Good","description":"\u003cp\u003ePraise for Michael Robotham:  'He writes in a voice with a haunting sense of soul' - Peter James  'Robotham is the real deal' - David Baldacci  'One of crime's greatest practitioners . . . a ripper, suspenseful read' - The Australian 'Robotham doesn't just make me scared for his characters, he makes my heart ache for them' - Linwood Barclay  'Michael Robotham has done it again - another accomplished crime novel unlike anything he has ever written before' - Sydney Morning Herald  'Excellent' - Literary Review The next novel by Michael Robotham is an unnerving psychological thriller that will keep you on the edge of your seat and you will not be able to put it down.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 126 x 196\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Michael Robotham\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780751573497\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 476\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45871457599641,"sku":"12RE9780751573497","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/690f1c5e8d408_When_She_Was_Good.jpg?v=1762600247","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/when-she-was-good","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}